  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "永續金融",
    "sub_ename": "SUSTAINABLE FINANCE",
    "describe_ch": "永續金融是目前最重要的永續議題之一，它不僅涉及金融業，也影響到企業是否能順利獲得融資和投資。本課程涵蓋永續金融的概念與實務，包括永續金融的概念與其對生態永續和企業發展的影響、有關的國際趨勢與規範、永續金融的運作方式等。",
    "describe_eh": "Sustainable finance is one of the most important sustainability issues nowadays, which not only involves the financial industry, but also affects the success of enterprises in obtaining financing and investment. This course covers the concepts and practices of sustainable finance, including the concept of sustainable finance and its impact on ecological sustainability and business development, relevant international trends and regulations, and the operation of sustainable finance.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
